---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Cookie notice" description="Kora Desk uses essential cookies and optional analytics with consent.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 prose-kora">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl">Cookie notice</h1>
    <p>Essential cookies remember your cookie choice. They are required for that banner to stay dismissed.</p>
    <p>Analytics cookies (Plausible or similar) load only if you tap “Accept analytics”. They count visits without advertising profiles.</p>
    <p>The site works if you choose “Essential only”. You can change your mind by clearing this site’s storage in your browser.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
